@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 🏠 1. TEST - Obtener información de la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 📋 2. TEST - Obtener todos los ejercicios (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/exercises

### 👤 3. TEST - Registrar nuevo usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test User",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 🔑 4. TEST - Login (SIN SCRIPT POR AHORA)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 💪 5. TEST - Crear workout (con token manual por ahora)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjIsImVtYWlsIjoidGVzdEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc1ODkzNTUxNywiZXhwIjoxNzU5NTQwMzE3fQ.vL5oopyre4Z340QB6VWG8R98HYlrHeHVBAQa_jW9gPw

{
    "name": "Mi Primer Workout",
    "exercises": [
        {
            "exerciseId": 1,
            "sets": 3,
            "reps": 10,
            "weight": 50
        }
    ],
    "notes": "Workout de prueba"
}

### 📋 6. TEST - Obtener workouts del usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjIsImVtYWlsIjoidGVzdEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc1ODkzNTUxNywiZXhwIjoxNzU5NTQwMzE3fQ.vL5oopyre4Z340QB6VWG8R98HYlrHeHVBAQa_jW9gPw

